<%--
View_Section_Abstract - section/card chrome base (background, border, radius, shadow)

The single home of section/card chrome, which IS Bootstrap's .card. Concrete
children (Section, Card_Widget, Detail_Sidebar) re-parent this base via
body-preserving extends= and render their own template; each restates the shared
root classes. Never used directly as a tag.

Reskinning the app's card look is one edit here - view_section_abstract.scss
points Bootstrap's card padding tokens at the app's composition tokens.
--%>
<Define:View_Section_Abstract class="card shadow-sm">
    <%= content() %>
</Define:View_Section_Abstract>
